{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日瘋傳一段影片，有目擊者在元朗直擊一輛電動三輪車竟直接駛上馬路行車道穿梭。片中所見，該三輪車載貨量驚人，車上裝滿各樣貨物之餘，司機身旁更「擠」着一名乘客一同乘搭，駕駛行為相當冒險。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-16h08m37s825.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20268mxSP2zqOx1790760263.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-16h08m37s825.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-16h08m46s694.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026sisubvvUem1790760254.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-16h08m46s694.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片引發大批網民圍觀及熱議，留言呈現批評與幽默抽水兩極反應：</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">·       批評違規派：大批網民怒斥車輛無牌上路極具危險性，留言直指：「冇牌都可以喺馬路行」、「無車牌架喎！離晒大譜」。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">·       幽默抽水派：亦有網民發揮搞笑本色，留言打趣指：「正喎！改裝下可以變篤篤」、「元朗係零捨不同」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T01:19:02.835579+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}